content:
Help me define bounded contexts. Below I will provide domain information. 

#### Data:
These are the extracted objects and the subdomain grouping:
```json
{
  "domain objects": [
    {
      "name": "Sales Consultant",
      "description": "Initiates and manages client research requests."
    },
    {
      "name": "Research Need",
      "description": "Client's expressed research requirement."
    },
    {
      "name": "Client",
      "description": "Requester of the research project."
    },
    {
      "name": "Project Proposal",
      "description": "Outline of project scope and approach."
    },
    {
      "name": "Project Manager",
      "description": "Oversees study planning and coordination."
    },
    {
      "name": "Study Plan",
      "description": "Plan detailing study tasks and timelines."
    },
    {
      "name": "Internal Milestone",
      "description": "Scheduled checkpoint for study progress."
    },
    {
      "name": "Research Analyst",
      "description": "Collects and analyzes research data."
    },
    {
      "name": "Field Researcher",
      "description": "Gathers primary data from participants."
    },
    {
      "name": "Raw Data",
      "description": "Unprocessed collected data."
    },
    {
      "name": "Data Analysis",
      "description": "Process of examining and interpreting data."
    },
    {
      "name": "Interview",
      "description": "Conversation to gather insights."
    },
    {
      "name": "Participant",
      "description": "Individual taking part in interviews."
    },
    {
      "name": "Interview Data",
      "description": "Transcripts and notes from interviews."
    },
    {
      "name": "Quality Reviewer",
      "description": "Checks and validates research reports."
    },
    {
      "name": "Research Report",
      "description": "Draft report of findings."
    },
    {
      "name": "Final Report",
      "description": "Approved report sent to client."
    }
  ]
}
```
```json
{
  "subdomains": {
    "Field Research": {
      "objects": [
